[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0398","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0212","title":"Sun Solaris rpc.mountd 错误信息泄露漏洞","description":"Solaris/SunOS 系统中 RPC 服务 rpc.mountd 存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 请求触发该服务返回详细错误信息，从而枚举服务器上的文件系统结构和文件是否存在。该漏洞影响 Solaris 及 SunOS 多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，为后续攻击收集目标信息。官方已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0212"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-04-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"安装 Sun Security Bulletin #168 (1998年发布) 对应的操作系统补丁，更新至已修复该问题的 Solaris 版本。如无法打补丁，可在 /etc/hosts.deny 中添加 \"mountd: ALL\" 并用 /etc/hosts.allow 按需放行可信主机，同时在防火墙上限制对 rpc.mountd (端口 2049 及 rpcbind 端口 111) 的访问。若不需要 NFS 服务，可停止并禁用 mountd 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/168","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-048.shtml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0170","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0069","title":"Sun Solaris ufsdump/ufsrestore 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 系统中的 ufsdump/ufsrestore 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，拥有本地访问权限的攻击者可通过向该工具传递特制参数触发溢出，覆盖内存数据，进而实现权限提升或以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7.0 版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高危，需系统本地账号方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0069"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-04-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:30Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至 Solaris 8 及以上版本，或安装 Sun 官方补丁 106880-01 (SPARC) / 106881-01 (x86)。临时缓解措施：限制 ufsdump/ufsrestore 的 setuid 权限，仅授权管理用户执行文件系统备份操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/169","http://www.osvdb.org/8158","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e