4-29T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 KDE 1.1 或更高版本。该漏洞已在 KDE 1.1 版本中修复，建议用户升级至包含补丁的最新版本。对于已停止维护的旧系统，建议迁移至受支持的 KDE 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9121","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1643"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1334.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1261","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1390","title":"Debian suidmanager suidexec 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian suidmanager 0.18 版本中的 suidexec 程序存在权限验证缺陷，本地攻击者可通过在命令行参数中指定恶意程序路径，利用该工具以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而获取系统最高控制权。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.0 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击前提是需要拥有本地系统账号及 shell 访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1390"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-04-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:20Z","remediation":"建议升级 suidmanager 至 0.18 以上版本，或直接移除 suidmanager 软件包（apt-get remove suidmanager）。如无法升级，可移除 /usr/bin/suidexec 的 SUID 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidexec）以消除提权风险。长期方案建议升级至 Debian 3.0 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://darwin.bio.uci.edu/~mcoogan/bugtraq/msg00890.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19080","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1390","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1390.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1390.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0