包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NFR 1.5/1.6 中的 nfrd 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送构造的 TCP 空首部（null header）及空数据（null data）字段的畸形数据包，导致 nfrd 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Network Flight Recorder 1.5 及 1.6 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前厂商已不再维护该产品，建议升级至替代解决方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1503"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:34Z","remediation":"升级 NFR 至 2.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。如厂商已停止支持无法升级，建议在边界防火墙上配置规则过滤畸形 TCP 报文（空头部/空数据字段），或限制对 nfrd 服务的网络访问权限。同时考虑迁移至替代性网络监控方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/63","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/055024821531fe5a0cbc9011c12b04dd02c9b91a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1503.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1503","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1503.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b486315e56d9788648fd79d97e0d99cfccdee160/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1503.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e21b8fd192c5b9344c0fc3526873d889a75be6c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q8g8-57rf-gprq/GHSA-q8g8-57rf-gprq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/63/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1503.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6eb9f70d-bc12-41d5-87e1-ddd5f6d07d8f.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1542","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1502","title":"id Software Quake 客户端缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Quake 1.9 客户端存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程恶意服务器可通过向客户端发送超长的预缓存路径、服务器名称、服务器地址或 map 控制台命令参数触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Quake 1.9 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。建议用户升级至 QuakeWorld 或使用官方补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1502"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:34Z","remediation":"升级到 QuakeWorld 或使用 QuakeSpasm、FTE QuakeWorld 等现代开源客户端，这些版本已修复缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，仅连接受信任的 Quake 服务器，避免连接不明来源的服务器，并在防火墙规则中限制 Quake 客户端（端口 26000-27000）仅向白名单 IP 发起连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=89205623028934&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/68","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/69","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/055024821531fe5a0cbc9011c12b04dd02c9b91a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1502","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1502.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b486315e56d9788648fd79d97e0d99cfccdee160/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1502.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a98ecc0a2017806af2e68e480b70154156d9c756/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5rv-r7cr-2prg/GHSA-j5rv-r7cr-2prg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/68/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1502.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000284.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1291","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1504","title":"Stalker Internet Mail Server 1.6 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Stalker Internet Mail Server 1.6 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长 HELO 命令触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需认证即可远程触发，影响邮件服务器的正常可用性。虽然官方 CVSS 评分较低，但 ExploitDB 将其归类为远程缓冲区溢出，存在被进一步利用实现代码执行的潜在风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1504"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:34Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议立即迁移至仍受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix 3.x 或 Exim 4.x）。若无法立即迁移，可在 SMTP 代理或防火墙层面添加规则，限制 HELO 命令参数长度不超过 256 字节，以临时缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/8951","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/62","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19047","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/055024821531fe5a0cbc9011c12b04dd02c9b91a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1504.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1504","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1504.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b486315e56d9788648fd79d97e0d99cfccdee160/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1504.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/be3041c9daa194f60d48accaf373dcfbc8db3012/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qjcj-gc7c-j4r2/GHSA-qjcj-gc7c-j4r2.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smtp_helo.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1504.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/62/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1238","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1114","title":"SGI IRIX Korn Shell suid_exec 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.4 及更早版本中 Korn Shell (ksh) 的 suid_exec 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该 setuid 程序传入特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.x 及更早版本操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1114"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"SGI 已于 1999 年发布 IRIX 6.5 及后续安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议立即升级至 IRIX 6.5.22 及以上版本。如无法升级，可通过 `chmod 4555 /usr/lib/ksh/suid_exec` 移除 suid_exec 的 setuid 位，禁止普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序，作为临时缓解措施。对于仍在运行 IRIX 的系统，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-15a.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/467","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2100","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e25ede9c3545efaa8ff0b393e30e48edb07502a8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1114.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1114","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1114.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1114.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fjg7-227f-7rfj/GHSA-fjg7-227f-7rfj.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000282.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2b2febe6-40dd-4e6a-9b8a-57d63e732aa3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1114.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1227","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1015","title":"Apple AppleShare IP Mail Server 远程拒绝服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple 公司出品的 AppleShare IP Mail Server 5.0.3（运行于 MacOS 8.1 及更早版本）的 SMTP 服务在处理客户端命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该服务在解析 HELO 命令时未对输入长度做有效边界校验，当远程攻击者向目标邮件服务器发送超出预期长度的超长 HELO 命令参数时，会导致缓冲区溢出并使服务进程崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务（DoS）。攻击无需身份认证，只要攻击者可网络访问目标服务器的 SMTP 端口即可发起，影响范围为部署了上述版本 AppleShare Mail Server 的 MacOS 8.1 及更早系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1015"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:31Z","remediation":"立即将 AppleShare IP Mail Server 升级至 Apple 后续发布的修复版本（建议升级到 Mac OS 9 配套的 AppleShare IP 6.x 或更新的 Mail Server 组件）。在无法立即升级的情况下，应在边界防火墙或邮件网关上限制仅允许可信内网 IP 访问 25 端口的 SMTP 服务，丢弃超长 HELO 命令请求，并部署入侵检测规则拦截异常长度的 SMTP 命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=89200657216213&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/61","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2126251525a2d370ea93bd7affc3a9b71b419b4c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1015.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1015","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1015.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d281505551869bb381f43b6d1c6cb3abf45ad885/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1015.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q25m-8j2c-m6fp/GHSA-q25m-8j2c-m6fp.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smtp_helo.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1015.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000280.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f8d04726-d7a9-4b2c-bcd5-81b99b896744.json","https://github.com/D14b0l1c/vulnerability-analyzer/blob/f6e8040ce803e0ca2c5b05b240848cd14c1adfab/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0373","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0190","title":"Sun Solaris rpcbind 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统的 rpcbind 服务存在任意文件写入漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统的 rpcbind 服务发送特制 RPC 请求，利用符号链接或文件路径遍历等方式覆盖系统任意文件，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议及时安装对应安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0190"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:49Z","remediation":"立即应用 Sun Security Bulletin #167 提供的补丁程序，或升级到 Solaris 7 及以上版本。作为临时缓解措施，在 /etc/hosts.deny 中添加 ALL:ALL 限制 rpcbind 访问，并在防火墙上仅允许受信任网络访问 rpcbind 端口 111/TCP 和 111/UDP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/167"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0046","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0011","title":"ISC BIND 4.9/8 CNAME及区域传输拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 4.9 和 BIND 8 版本的域名解析服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者通过发送特制的 CNAME 资源记录或利用不规范的区域传输（Zone Transfer）请求，可导致目标 BIND 服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，停止响应正常的域名解析请求。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 DNS 服务器，在无需认证的条件下即可触发，对网络基础设施的可用性构成直接威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0011"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 ISC BIND 至 8.2 及以上版本，推荐直接迁移至 BIND 9.x 系列。在 named.conf 中配置 allow-transfer 仅允许受信从服务器（如 allow-transfer { 192.168.1.2; };），并在面向不可信网络的接口上通过 allow-query 和 allow-recursion 限制查询来源。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙阻断外部对 TCP 53 端口的区域传输请求，并限制 UDP 53 的异常 CNAME 查询流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/180","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9808-083"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0044","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0010","title":"ISC BIND 4.9/8 DNS Message 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 4.9 及 8 版本中的 DNS 消息处理组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的恶意 DNS 查询消息，利用消息解析过程中的缺陷触发服务崩溃，导致 DNS 服务不可用。该漏洞影响大量使用上述版本 BIND 的 DNS 服务器，攻击者通过发送精心构造的 DNS 请求报文即可实施攻击，无需复杂前置条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0010"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:20Z","remediation":"升级至 BIND 8.2 或更高版本以修复 DNS 消息解析缺陷；BIND 4.9/8 系列已停止维护，建议迁移至 BIND 9.x 系列并升级到 ISC 发布的最新稳定版（如 9.18.x 或 9.20.x）。如暂无法升级，应在边界防火墙上限制外部 DNS 查询来源 IP 并启用递归查询访问控制列表以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9808-083"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0030","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0009","title":"ISC BIND 反向查询远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND（Berkeley Internet Name Domain）4.9 及 8.x 版本存在反向查询缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的反向查询请求，触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 BIND 4.9 及 8.x 的多种操作系统平台，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商建议立即升级至不受影响的版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0009"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-04-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 BIND 至 8.2 或更高版本，或在条件允许时迁移至 BIND 9 系列（如 9.3.0+），因为 8.2 已修复逆查询缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 named.conf 中禁用 `inverse-query` 选项以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/180","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/134","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9808-083","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19112","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0009","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/ce91429859b5110820b1d31a41b0b1a3c67d9603/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0009.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0009.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/252.txt","https://github.com/demisto/content/blob/710308a4be78e89bc993b4d594b444aeb805b7d8/Packs/McAfeeNSM/Integrations/McAfeeNSMv2/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p4fw-6pfr-4xqr/GHSA-p4fw-6pfr-4xqr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24ebb1752fdaa57c8d421b21085e47d359e1300e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0009.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/deleted.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/bind_iquery.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0030.toml"}]